Subject: WebKit: Phoenix multi-call processes; SharedMemory and wl_shm pools over shmsrv; shm log

One static program is the UI, web and network process: findWebKitProcess() returns
WPE_PHOENIX_EXECUTABLE (set by the program's main) or WPE_PHOENIX_DEFAULT_EXECUTABLE, and the
launcher passes the child's role in WPE_PHOENIX_PROCESS_ROLE. WebCore::SharedMemory and
WPEPlatform's wl_shm pools allocate with memfd_create() from the wayland_phoenix compat library
(shmsrv objects). WPE_PHOENIX_SHM_LOG=1 prints every allocation, mapping and pool (re)size.

diff --git a/Source/WebCore/platform/unix/SharedMemoryUnix.cpp b/Source/WebCore/platform/unix/SharedMemoryUnix.cpp
index c534f8fe7e32b62d5c1b9584aaaa109e836086ff..cfdcc47bf8756a0505f439d8a15d131727be4dae 100644
--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/unix/SharedMemoryUnix.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/unix/SharedMemoryUnix.cpp
@@ -50,8 +50,43 @@
